{"reviews":[{"id":"B08JZG5WN6-0","r":2.0,"t":"PLASTIC top not bamboo","x":"I hate having to comb through all of the minutiae of a product.  The lids are cheap plastic.  If you want a nice glass jar with a bamboo lid, this isn't it.","h":45,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B08JZG5WN6-1","r":4.0,"t":"Don't leave in the cold","x":"I love the look of These . Perfect size to hold monomer and polymer however we live in Chicago, the container holding the monomer was left in the car in 25/30\u00b0 weather overnight. The lid froze and cracked & broke while opening.","h":21,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B08JZG5WN6-2","r":1.0,"t":"Cheap lids","x":"The lids are thin and not made of real wood, overtime the paper covering starts to \u201csplit\u201d causing any creams to leak out. The jars are nice but without a better lid this is a waste of money.","h":17,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08JZG5WN6-3","r":1.0,"t":"Disappointed.","x":"These containers are cute, but apparently, fragile. Out of the four that came in the set, two of the jars were broken. I would suggest buying BPA free plastic containers. I will not purchase these again.","h":11,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B08JZG5WN6-4","r":3.0,"t":"Good, but not quite...","x":"It's a great sturdy glass jar. I bought these to make my own lip balms. The lid is not real wood, it just has a wood appearance which was kind of disappointing. There is a white plastic seal on the inside, and it does not fit snuggly in the opening of the jar. If you take the lid off and turn it upside down the seal just falls out. If you were putting anything in here that wasn't solid like an oil or even a cream, there is a good possibility that it would leak. The balms that I put in them are s","h":9,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B08JZG5WN6-5","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect for travel or for diy","x":"I used these to make my own lip balm , lip scrub ,and other diy . Good use and aestetically pleasing","h":9,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B08JZG5WN6-6","r":2.0,"t":"Not for Traveling","x":"I purchased these to take some cosmetics on a trip.  The lids do not seal tightly and product leaked out.  Will not use again.","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08JZG5WN6-7","r":5.0,"t":"Great quality","x":"For the price I didn\u2019t expect much at all. But the jars look fantastic and the lid almost wood like. Looks expensive and classy not cheap.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B08JZG5WN6-8","r":1.0,"t":"Disappointed","x":"I had to return these.  The lids had already started to peel, right out the box.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B08JZG5WN6-9","r":3.0,"t":"Okay, but the lids are cheap plastic.","x":"The containers are cute but the lids are cheap plastic. I thought they would be wood, but it\u2019s just painted/stickered on a pretty flimsy plastic lid.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B08JZG5WN6-10","r":5.0,"t":"perfect","x":"I mix oils for hair & scalp and wanted to do stocking suffers for Xmas. these were absolutely perfect","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B08JZG5WN6-11","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect size","x":"Perfect glass container for my intense moisture creme\ud83d\udc93","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B08JZG5WN6-12","r":5.0,"t":"Use for monomer","x":"Bought this to use for monomer works great!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B08JZG5WN6-13","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect size for eye creams","x":"I make my own eye creams, so I had been watching for awhile for some sturdy glass jars.  These fit the bill.  They are quite attractive, seal well, and hold one months worth of cream in each one (I throw out extra cream after it is a month old).  I highly recommend these.  They were well packaged on arrival in bubble wrap and then wrapped again in paper and then put into a cardboard box.  I will be ordering these again!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B08JZG5WN6-14","r":3.0,"t":"Will hold almost anything.","x":"Bought these for my nail kit and storage is short so I used one for slip solution, isopropyl alcohol (ISA) and acetone (nail polish remover) to clean my brushes... The acetone ate the plastic and leaked. Good thing it was stored right side up or it could have been disastrous. I use a different container for that now.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2022"},{"id":"B08JZG5WN6-15","r":5.0,"t":"Works well!","x":"I bought this for being able to take some of my skincare products with myself while traveling for work, without needing to lug everything with me. I wish they had a smaller quantity available for purchase because it was a lot of containers that I didn\u2019t need but I like it! No spills and convenient for travel.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B08JZG5WN6-16","r":4.0,"t":"Top Notch","x":"I bought these containers for the purpose of storing hair care products that I used in a smaller traveling container. They don\u2019t leak, they\u2019re small and compact, and they\u2019re sturdy with a nice look to them. Great design and great functionality. Really happy with the product, especially for the price.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B08JZG5WN6-17","r":4.0,"t":"Convenient, cheap lid","x":"I like the glass jar. There is a plastic piece under the lid to help prevent leaks which is nice. Do not like the lid. Feels thin and cheap and like it might break of tightened to tight. Also I little to large for what I needed but I couldn\u2019t find anything I liked that was smaller","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2021"},{"id":"B08JZG5WN6-18","r":1.0,"t":"Lid cracked in half within a week","x":"The lid of one of these cracked in half meaning that it's now useless and has no lid. The glass part is thick and sturdy, but the lids are not, meaning they aren't good for traveling. Even before it cracked, I was skeptical that it was leakproof as it seemed flimsy.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B08JZG5WN6-19","r":5.0,"t":"Good value, look really nice.","x":"Nice looking little glass jars, I'll use them when traveling. Lids are plastic, but look like bamboo, and they have an inner seal to prevent leaks. Look so much nicer than the regular plastic travel containers you usually see. I'm happy with this purchase.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B08JZG5WN6-20","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect for many things!","x":"I bought them to mix my tattoo-covering makeup. They're a perfect size. I'm also using them for paint. I'm starting to do art and they're the perfect size for that, too! The lid fits great and is easy to screw on and off.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B08JZG5WN6-21","r":5.0,"t":"So grateful for these","x":"I had to depot some expensive makeup and skincare and these make me feel like I am still using a luxury product rather than putting them in a plastic one so this was a great choice. Very sturdy too.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2022"},{"id":"B08JZG5WN6-22","r":5.0,"t":"Great Product","x":"These bottles are perfect for storing products that are a part of your beauty, hair regiment as well as other health and beauty endeavors you may try. I'm completely satisfied with my purchase.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B08JZG5WN6-23","r":5.0,"t":"Cute, buy them","x":"I got these for a lip butter that kept coming out of the tube from pressure. Super cute and functional. I love them! They don\u2019t seem cheap at all and I love that you get so many for the price.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B08JZG5WN6-24","r":3.0,"t":"Cover broke with very little use","x":"Used this for cosmetics, sits on my vanity. The cover cracked and no longer screws down tight. The glass seems nice and sturdy,  and has a high end look. Wish the cover was better quality.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2021"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Several reviewers are disappointed that the lids are cheap plastic with a fake wood appearance rather than real bamboo or wood.","cites":[1,3,5,10]},{"text":"Some reviewers report the lids do not seal tightly, causing products to leak.","cites":[3,7,15]},{"text":"A number of reviewers find the glass jars cute, attractive, and good quality for the price.","cites":[6,8,11,12,14]},{"text":"Some reviewers report durability problems, including cracked or broken jars and lids that peel or crack.","cites":[2,4,9]},{"text":"Several reviewers successfully use the jars for DIY projects like lip balm, creams, and oils.","cites":[6,11,12,14]}]},"qa":[]}